Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.21,2:05:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后 恩菲尔德闹鬼事件成为了 超自然历史记录上有名的案子之一
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.89,2:05:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩吉·霍奇斯继续在格林街的这栋房子里度过她的余生
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.36,2:05:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,2003年 她坐在客厅的一把椅子上安详的离开
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.03,2:05:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是40年前比尔·威尔金斯去世时那把椅子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在看过了那么多事情之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything we've seen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.52,0:00:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少能有再让我们惊慌的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there isn't much that rattles either of us anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,依旧阴魂不散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one still haunts me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们介入前的两个月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two months prior to our involvement, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢兹一家在半夜逃离了家门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Lutz family had fled their home in the middle of the night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,声称房子闹鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}claiming that the house was haunted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,教堂向我们寻求帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Church had reached out to us for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted to see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能否确认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we could confirm the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢兹一家报告的事是否属实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}activity that had been reported by the Lutzes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么开始吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's get started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你们安静地坐下 闭上眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like you to sit quietly and close your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象自己在闪着白光的光晕里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Envision yourself in a halo of glowing white light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会保护你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢兹家搬进这里之前的一年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The year before the Lutzes moved in, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.94,0:02:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名叫罗尼·笛福的年轻男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a young man named Ronny DeFeo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这座房子里残忍地杀害了他的整个家庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}had brutally murdered his entire family in this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd hoped to discover if{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次杀戮是否纯粹是因为愤怒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the killings had been motivated purely by anger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说 像罗尼·笛福 在法庭作证时所说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if, as Ronny DeFeo testified in court, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被一些邪恶的东西操控了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had been under the influence of something demonic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这儿 留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here. Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她 杀了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her. Kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,射死她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪 杀了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot her. Kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们都杀死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她 开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her. Shoot her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她 开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her. Shoot her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你还好吗 你看到了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you okay? What are you seeing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗琳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗琳 发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine, what is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了 时间到了 该回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're through. We're through. It's time to come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想给我看些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants to show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗琳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗琳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Oh!{\r}
