Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.48,0:07:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我能忍受的最接近地狱地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is as close to hell as I ever wanna get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 讨厌的小孩 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn kids! - Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和基思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keith and I are going to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,打算和他朋友迈克尔偷偷溜出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sneak out tonight with his friend, Michael, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说句 他很想见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who wants to meet you, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.68,0:09:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 如果被我妈妈发现就死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. If my mum ever found out, I'd be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别被发现啊 ⁮娘娘腔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't get caught, you priss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 拿着这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, hold this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我们做的通灵板还给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta give you back the spirit board that we made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我会让基思法式热吻我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll let Keith French kiss me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 认真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you two doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 把烟拿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, give that to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个 进屋去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get inside, both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.48,0:09:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛 玛 玛格丽特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-M-M-M-Margaret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格丽特 约翰尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret! Johnny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet! Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀 今天过得怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. How was your day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言难尽 我之后再告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long story. I'll tell you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,最 最 最近怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-w-what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,比 比 比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-B-B-B-Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 彼得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾丝边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lesbo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你在说你妈吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you talking about your mum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 卡米拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Camilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是个傻逼 别理他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a wanker. Ignore him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.68,0:10:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈会杀了我的 - 你干了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mum's gonna kill me. - What did you do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我 是卡米拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't me, it was Camilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和卡米拉干什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do with Camilla?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一言难尽 - 孩子们 看路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a long story. - Boys! Watch the road!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍妮特 - 上吧 比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Janet! - Up you go, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我这个月付不了房租{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying I won't be able to pay my rent this month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我和他们说了 他们让我和你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I talked to them, and they put me through to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please keep calm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:10:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am being calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不理解为什么你不能帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't understand why you can't help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他赡养费三个月来一分钱都没付{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He hasn't paid a penny of child maintenance for three months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们回来了 - 我看到了 真他妈棒啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're home! - I see. That's bloody brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 妈妈 - 也祝你下午好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Mum! - You have a good afternoon as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还嫌事情不够多么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are things not bad enough around here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.72,0:11:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接到你校长的电话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I've got to get a call from your headmistress{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她抓到你抽烟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who says that you was caught smoking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 我没有抽烟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't! I wasn't smoking. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你收到饼干了么 - 你听见我说话了么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get the biscuits? - Did you just not hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.24,0:11:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和莫尔女士在电话里谈过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to Mrs. More on the telephone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能当着面这样对我撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you stand there and lie to me like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not lying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是在撒谎 整个学校都知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, she is! It's all over the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和卡米拉在一起抽烟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was smoking with Camilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.12,0:11:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 约翰尼 你就是个骗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! You are such a liar, Johnny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你说过你会给我带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mum! You said we would get me some…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 比利 我他妈没买饼干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Billy. I didn't get any bloody biscuits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们他妈的没钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we don't have any bloody money!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈要上来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mum's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱折腾了 快去刷牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better quit messing with that and brush your teeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是整个城市都烧起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like the whole city's burning down in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我找到了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what I found!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,饼干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biscuits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你说过我们没钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you said we don't have any money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我准备要戒烟的 省下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've been meaning to quit smoking anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛格丽特 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Margaret? - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.48,0:12:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好明天的校服了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got your school uniform for tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 妈妈 我正在弄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mum. I'm getting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼 你刷牙了么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, did you brush your teeth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刷过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 比利 该睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Billy. Time for bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上来 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming, Mum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下 约翰尼 该睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that down, Johnny. Come on. Time for bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 这是哪儿来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, where'd that come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡米拉和我在学校做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camilla and I made it at school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来不行啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. That doesn't look right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.16,0:12:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的有用 我发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really works, I swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经问了各种各样的东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already asked it all sorts of stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我弄给你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该问什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 什么都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Whatever you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹和我想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister and I want to know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有灵魂愿意和我们交流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any spirits here that want to communicate with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸还会回来吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Dad ever coming home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有鬼魂愿意回答我的问题吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any spirits here who can answer my question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个愚蠢的游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a stupid game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么拍门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why're you pounding on the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真傻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're barmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 她正在测试我的极限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, she's pushing the boundary, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她没有抽烟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says she wasn't smoking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说我对此感到烦恼 佩格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you should agonize over it, Peg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道 你们在学校也得做苦差事 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows I had my share of fags at school, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, lots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.80,0:16:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她做的那些事并没有困扰我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not what she did that bothers me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.60,0:16:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她不听我话了 佩吉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that, she don't listen to what I say anymore, Pegs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这个阶段嘛 是不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a phase, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是能惩罚她 可之后我会愧疚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can punish her, but then I feel guilty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我也不好说就是她错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I know it's not really her fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爱她爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loves her dad and she{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.67,0:16:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他离开的时候 她真的很难过 可怜的小姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}took it very hard when he left. Poor thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这事也不能就这样算了 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't just let it go either, can I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太想这么问 不过 你告诉理查德了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm loath to ask, but have you told Richard about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 如果我能见到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would, if I ever saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就像我要同时做两份工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it's like I'm having to do both jobs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一半 我得像以前般做好妈妈 我糟透了 佩吉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm half the mum I was before. I'm just rubbish, Peggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是 佩吉 别对自己太苛刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not, Peggy. You're too hard on yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh! - Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见鬼的房子 - 哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This sodding house! - Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又见面了 还有现实生活中的恶灵猎人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are back with real life ghost hunters, Ed and Lorraine Warren, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.36,0:17:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃德和罗琳·沃伦夫妇将来谈谈他们在阿米蒂维尔之屋的经历{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}talking about their experiences at the Amityville house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我们要问问另一位客人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we're gonna talk to my next guest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯蒂夫·卡普兰博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Steven Kaplan, who says{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.01,0:17:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说沃伦夫妇对阿米蒂维尔闹鬼事件的调查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the investigations the Warrens conducted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是胡说八道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the Amityville haunting is a load of hogwash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么说呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 可以说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's been well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.40,0:17:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米蒂维尔事件就是个明目张胆的骗局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}established that Amityville was a blatant hoax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这没有 - 这点从未被证实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But that hasn't stopped… - That's never been proven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢兹夫妇伪造了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lutz family made everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.36,0:17:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样他们就能从宣传中获利了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}up so they could profit off of all the publicity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我们一直以来都是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we see this all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,从旁观者的角度挑一段故事 这很容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very easy to sit on the outside and pick apart their story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你自己去那里真实地体验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's something very different{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.95,0:17:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是另一回事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have been there and experienced it for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:17:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不需要真的登上月球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to go to the moon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.85,0:17:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,才知道它不是「生干酪」做成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to know that it's not made out of green cheese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 埃德·沃伦去过的屋子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Ed Warren's never{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.75,0:18:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没有他认为不闹鬼的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}seen a house that he didn't think was haunted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妻子放完烟雾弹 吸引注意力之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the time his wife is done blowing smoke and ringing bells{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让其他所有人都相信闹鬼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've got everybody else believing in ghosts, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是哪门子的博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are you a doctor of, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊沃伦 优雅一点行吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Warren. Try and show a little class, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不想给那些坐在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna show class to somebody{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲我和我妻子坏话的人尊重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's sitting here telling lies about my wife and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意点 你叫谁骗子呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful who you call a liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说了 怎么着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来录这些节目是为了告知人们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go on these shows to inform people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.84,0:18:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是每次我开口 都有那些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But every time I open my mouth, another one of these little…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃德 - 狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ed. - Ass…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,学者们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Academics…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.76,0:18:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图诋毁我们所做的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tries to undo everything we've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能消停会儿吗 - 我知道 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could you please take a breath? - I know. I know. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.80,0:18:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我会数到十 数到十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm counting to 10. I'm counting to 10!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.28,0:18:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好演讲了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to do a speech?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我们再来一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. We'll just try again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.68,0:19:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得非常好 给你个饼干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting so good. Now you may have a biscuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.80,0:19:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,饼干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biscuit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 该睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on. Off to bed with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 妈妈 - 晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Night, Mom. - Good night, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吃这么多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't eat too many of those{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.48,0:19:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,省的半夜口渴醒来 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you'll wake up thirsty in the middle of the night. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.84,0:19:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 孩子们 - 晚安 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Night, boys. - Night, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.88,0:21:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.32,0:21:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 快醒醒 你在做噩梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, wake up! You're dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.56,0:21:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 你在这里做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在和比利玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing a game with Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave Billy alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.32,0:21:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 你在和谁说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, who are you talking to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是那个擅闯别人家的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one trespassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:21:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 快醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.64,0:22:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再不停下来 我要告诉我妈妈了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell my mum if you don't stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会拧断她的脖子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll break her neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.44,0:22:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.28,0:22:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,和比利一起死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dying with Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.48,0:22:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, it's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.40,0:22:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.56,0:22:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好睡吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许伤害比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我们远点 你听到了么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us alone. You hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.40,0:22:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 你在做什么 那里没人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, what are you doing? There's no one here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.40,0:22:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.84,0:26:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mum! Mum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.40,0:26:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mum! Mum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.04,0:26:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy? What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.60,0:26:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在我的帐篷里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone in my tent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.84,0:26:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.00,0:26:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在我的帐篷里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone in my tent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.12,0:26:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.24,0:27:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.72,0:27:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是做噩梦了 就这样而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just had a bad dream. That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.12,0:27:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,回房间睡吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to your room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.48,0:27:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.92,0:27:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.16,0:27:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心脏病都要被你吓出来了 你怎么下楼了 你在做什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You nearly gave me a heart attack. What're you doing down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.72,0:27:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我又梦游了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've been sleepwalking again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.00,0:27:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,又梦游了 什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean "Again"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.40,0:27:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.64,0:27:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在发烧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're burning up. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.52,0:28:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回房间吧 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get you back upstairs, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.32,0:28:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你明天就不用去学校了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you better stay home from school tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.32,0:28:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先回去睡觉吧 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get you back into bed, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.68,0:28:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我想做一个讨厌的艺术家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I want to be a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.86,0:28:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且成为一名可靠的画家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hair artiste and become a credible painter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.56,0:28:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别给我那些野蛮的宣传或者是异想天开的讨厌的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me any of your brute hype and airy-fairy hair…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.52,0:28:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒退30年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…back 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.80,0:28:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我回到10岁时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I've gone back to the age of 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.48,0:28:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有东西都是用软焦点拍的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is shot in soft focus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.16,0:28:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些虚构的借口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some bogus excuses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.32,0:28:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备什么时候离开那豪华的学校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When're you gonna leave that posh school, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.08,0:28:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后找一份适合男人的工作在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get yourself a proper man's job down…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.44,0:29:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 一首圣诞颂歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, a Christmas carol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.00,0:29:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪一个 - 所有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which one? - All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.12,0:29:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And within minutes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.88,0:29:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,主席先生 总统先生 女士们 先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chairman, Mr. President, ladies and gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.84,0:29:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我站在你们面前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand before you tonight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.80,0:29:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,身着红星雪纺晚礼服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my Red Star chiffon evening gown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.28,0:29:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍奇森家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hodgson residence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.72,0:30:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Hi, Mum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.20,0:30:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 有一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.88,0:30:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚吃过 所以不怎么饿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just ate, so I'm not really that hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.84,0:30:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我在听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.20,0:30:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,您什么时候回来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know when you'll be home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.12,0:30:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.72,0:30:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Mum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.88,0:30:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我就说铁娘子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am an iron lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.40,0:30:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,西方世界的铁娘子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Iron Lady of the Western world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.48,0:31:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 你很坏 你知道 你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. You are a bad one, you know, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.64,0:31:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的母亲 抱歉我迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother dearest, I'm sorry I am late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.08,0:31:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我必须停下给你买有益健康的黑面包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I had to stop off to get you a health-giving brown loaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.60,0:31:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听到这种理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not wish to hear about that sort of thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.80,0:31:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to come over here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.20,0:31:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意 让你老妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you don't mind me, and let your old mum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.40,0:31:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你刮了肚脐上的绒毛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}scrape the fluff out of your belly button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.72,0:31:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大游行上漂亮又干净 而且在星期天很适合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and clean for the big parade and very good on Sunday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.40,0:31:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该在那 你知道的 看着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be there, you know, watching you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.40,0:32:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.96,0:32:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你起的好早{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.44,0:32:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Yeah, I couldn't sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.96,0:32:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有灵感了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get inspired?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.52,0:32:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I'd call it that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.88,0:32:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了一个疯狂的梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this crazy dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.04,0:32:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我醒来的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.52,0:32:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I woke up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.60,0:32:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直困扰着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't get it out of my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.28,0:32:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想画下来也许会有帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thought maybe this might help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.24,0:33:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我知道我不是毕加索 但我画的没那么差吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I know I'm no Picasso, but I didn't think it was that bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.24,0:33:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该收山了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以做讲座 但不要接新案子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could still do the lectures, but no new cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.92,0:33:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码歇一阵子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least not for a little while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.84,0:33:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.76,0:33:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我为什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I ask why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.04,0:33:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是因为电视节目或是公关 那我们就不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if it's the TV shows and publicity then we won't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.36,0:33:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 早上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning. - Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.68,0:33:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,早{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.44,0:33:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you trust me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.04,0:33:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.76,0:33:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then please trust me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.92,0:34:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.60,0:34:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那是在做什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. What are you doing that for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.08,0:34:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一我又梦游{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case I go sleep walking again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.56,0:35:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.88,0:35:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.76,0:38:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 怎么了 这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet! What's wrong? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.36,0:38:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们房间里有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone in the room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.64,0:39:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人 你在说些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one! What you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.24,0:39:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 我们房间里有人啊 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's someone in our room! - What!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.04,0:39:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的床不停得晃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our beds are shaking up and down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.56,0:39:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 我发誓 如果你在撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, I swear to God if you're making it up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.80,0:39:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 你看 他咬我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got bit. I'm not lying! He bit me! Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.92,0:39:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.60,0:39:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们刚刚是不是在玩这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you two been playing with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.40,0:39:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮流去吓唬对方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking turns scaring the wits out of each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.76,0:39:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得你们都睡不着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder I can't get a good night's sleep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.56,0:39:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 不是的 - 别说了 我不想听你们继续撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But, Mum… - No! I don't wanna hear another word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.96,0:39:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩马上上床睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get back to bed, the lot of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.68,0:40:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.96,0:40:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命啊 - 救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please help! - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.16,0:40:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩吉 维克 开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peggy! Vic, open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.80,0:40:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.24,0:40:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼所见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen it with my own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.16,0:40:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那该死的东西穿过了整个房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bloody thing went clear across the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.32,0:40:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.60,0:40:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, then… - What? Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.84,0:40:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很冷 我仔细地检查了房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cold. Well, I've been through the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.96,0:40:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么人都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top to bottom. There's no one there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.12,0:40:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格丽特和珍妮特的房间呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Margaret and Janet's room? Did you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.04,0:40:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我去看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I looked there, every room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.72,0:40:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下室我都去看过了 我没看到什么人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even went down the basement. There's no one there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.56,0:40:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.36,0:40:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们教他 当他想上厕所时就摇这个铃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've taught him to ring the bell when he wants to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.60,0:40:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它出去吧 比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna let him out, Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.28,0:40:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快看 警察去我们家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! The police are at our house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.60,0:40:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what they doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.48,0:40:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我报的警 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I called them. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.52,0:40:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是有人在恶作剧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, it's got{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.40,0:40:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be somebody playing a joke on you, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.32,0:40:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.32,0:41:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不是只有您看到那个人 对吗 女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, ma'am. You didn't actually see the man yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.08,0:41:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.56,0:41:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来那个人是你们编造出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't think she's making it up. Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.16,0:41:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我觉得这一切肯定能有个解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look. There has to be some sort of explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.24,0:41:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 这就是我们在这里的原因 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, that's why we're here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.52,0:42:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,从厨房给我拿一张椅子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me a chair from the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.56,0:42:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,音来自墙体里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming from inside the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.52,0:42:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么呢 也许是老鼠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what? Mice, maybe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.16,0:42:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的老鼠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big bloody mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.20,0:42:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对此无能为力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's nothing we can do about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.92,0:42:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会提交一个报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can file an incident{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.89,0:42:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你需要的话 我们随时待命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}report and we'll stand by it if anyone asks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's about all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.12,0:42:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告 哦 真是太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A report? Oh. That's brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.24,0:42:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所遇到的问题都特么填一个表格就解决了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every problem I have, there's another bloody form to fill out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.92,0:42:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for God's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.96,0:42:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.20,0:43:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这超出了我们的能力范围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is a bit beyond us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.68,0:43:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识一个神父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The priest at our church is a family friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.68,0:43:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让他来帮助你们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ask him to call on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.52,0:43:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些诚实的人留在这个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are still some honest people left in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.12,0:43:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她说 发生的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she said, what happened was, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.20,0:43:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在杂货店时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she was at the grocery store.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.56,0:43:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把钱包落在那了 在杂货店里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left her wallet there, at the grocery store.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.16,0:43:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有钱 很多钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had money in it, a lot of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.04,0:43:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是她想 好吧 就这样吧 已经没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she thought, "Well, that's that. It's gone."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.48,0:43:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为有人会把它捡走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thought someone was just gonna pick it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.12,0:43:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, that's that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.80,0:43:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当想看看还能做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just to see what she could do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.20,0:43:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她回到了杂货店 果然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she went back to the grocery store and sure enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.80,0:43:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个诚实的女士捡到了钱包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some honest woman had picked up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.97,0:43:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,并归还到了经理那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wallet and returned it to the manager there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.48,0:43:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她找回了所有东西 包括她的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got everything back. She got her money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.64,0:43:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她拿回了手袋里的所有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got everything that was in the purse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.72,0:44:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.68,0:44:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.80,0:44:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.68,0:44:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.88,0:44:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.56,0:44:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.16,0:48:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.32,0:48:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me who you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.88,0:48:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 妈妈 快醒醒 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! Mom. Mom! Wake up! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.96,0:48:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.88,0:48:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 洛林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.20,0:48:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.32,0:48:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.48,0:48:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍奇森夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Hodgson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.04,0:48:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.28,0:48:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫 肯特·艾伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Kent Allen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.44,0:48:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在做一档电视新闻节目 叫广角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're with the television news program Wide Angle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.12,0:48:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和您谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping to have a word with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.83,0:49:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于上周您家里发生的事儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you about the disturbance at your home last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.04,0:49:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you find out about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.68,0:49:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,警员写了一个报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police constables filed an incident report. It's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.24,0:49:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个报告让我们很惊讶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's raised a few eyebrows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.04,0:49:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想自己的家事儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather not have my business spread all over the telly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.72,0:49:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现在电视节目里 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you don't mind. Good day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.20,0:49:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种情况还在发生吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it still happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.15,0:49:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是的话 让大家知道你的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if it is getting your side of the story out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.56,0:49:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是寻求帮助最好的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}might be your best chance of finding help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.72,0:49:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开机了吗 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing on? Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.64,0:49:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们眼前这座看似平淡无奇的房子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind the doors of this seemingly normal house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.80,0:49:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一家人正生活在一场噩梦之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Ponders End, North London, is a family living in a nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.80,0:49:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我透过窗户往上看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look up, and through the window, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.68,0:49:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,能清楚看见小女孩 珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}plain as day, I see the younger girl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.88,0:49:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天上飞 就好像她漂浮着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, being thrown around in the air like she was floating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.68,0:49:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶紧跑回屋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we run back inside and sure enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.12,0:49:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种小的乐高玩具砖块在整个房间里飞着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's little toy LEGO bricks flying all around the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.12,0:49:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个还击中了我的右脸 太疼了 我都流血了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them hit me right in the face so hard it drew blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.76,0:49:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到那张椅子自己在地板上滑动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the chair slide by itself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.56,0:49:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我几步之遥的眼前移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}across the floor, a distance of several feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.40,0:49:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我检查了那张椅子是否连着电线什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked the chair for wires, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.92,0:49:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有 发生的一切无法解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but could find nothing to explain it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.00,0:50:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫里斯·格罗斯是工程学方面的顾问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maurice Grosse is an engineering consultant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.40,0:50:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了社会大众和物理研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has been investigating these{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.58,0:50:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,介入了此次调查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}claims for the Society of Psychical Research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.40,0:50:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这不是一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't think there's any doubt about it at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.24,0:50:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这起案件中 大量的文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sheer number of documented{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.08,0:50:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,都让人感到难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}incidents in this case is absolutely staggering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.40,0:50:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 安尼塔·格雷戈里 一位通灵者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Anita Gregory, a parapsychologist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.25,0:50:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及北伦敦理工学院的讲师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lecturer at the Polytechnic of North London, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.76,0:50:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不确信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not convinced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.24,0:50:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这的主角是所有孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our principal characters here are all children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.92,0:50:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子在恶作剧上是非常机灵的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And children can be very ingenious pranksters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.32,0:50:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这些可怕活动的中心人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the center of these{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.22,0:50:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是11岁的珍妮特·霍奇森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}frightening activities is 11-year-old Janet Hodgson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.76,0:50:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近采访了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recently interviewed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.72,0:50:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特和她14岁的姐姐玛格利特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet and her 14-year-old sister, Margaret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.12,0:50:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来发生的 会让你惊讶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened next will astonish you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.04,0:50:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,居住在闹鬼的房子里是一种什么体验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it feel living in a haunted house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.36,0:50:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.96,0:50:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你不会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.96,0:50:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧 发生这一切之前 我们只是平凡无奇的家庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, we was just a normal family before all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.80,0:50:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情变得越来越糟糕 自从格罗斯先生和它说话以后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been getting worse since Mr. Grosse started talking to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.64,0:50:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.28,0:50:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如问问题时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, asking it questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.56,0:50:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,说点头两次就代表是的 一次代表不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying knock twice for "Yes" And one for "No."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.96,0:50:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sort of thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.52,0:50:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果我们现在试试跟它说话会怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what would happen if we tried talking to it now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.68,0:51:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在这么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.80,0:51:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有人想聊聊的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody there who wishes to communicate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.12,0:51:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再问一次 有人在这么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say again, is anybody there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.84,0:51:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.08,0:51:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它又不是自动点唱机 对么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it isn't a jukebox, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.84,0:51:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 你还好么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.88,0:51:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.04,0:52:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.52,0:52:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.44,0:52:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 你感觉还好么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, are you feeling all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.96,0:52:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫我珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop calling me Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.12,0:52:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特不是你的名字么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.96,0:52:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特睡着了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet's asleep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.88,0:52:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是我在说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.60,0:52:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 阁下怎么称呼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what should I call you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.40,0:52:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你名字叫什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.48,0:52:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不属于这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't belong here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.32,0:52:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫莫里斯·格罗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Maurice Grosse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.60,0:52:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.44,0:53:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.80,0:53:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.96,0:53:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不是你的房子 现在告诉我你的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This is not your house. Now, what's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.48,0:53:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,咚 咚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock, knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.84,0:53:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.32,0:53:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在敲门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.68,0:53:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔 比尔\N字幕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill. Bill.\NI'd like you to leave, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.44,0:53:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔 比尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill. Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.04,0:53:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,全名呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.28,0:53:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫比尔·威金斯 我72岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Bill Wilkins and I'm 72 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.84,0:53:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得是谁发出来的这种声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.20,0:53:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从坟墓里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come from the grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.32,0:53:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.72,0:53:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失明了还流了很多血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went blind and had a hemorrhage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.08,0:53:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我阖了眼睑 死于角落里的椅子上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I fell asleep and I died in the chair in the corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.20,0:54:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why have you come here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.04,0:54:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢听到惊恐的尖叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to hear them scream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.68,0:54:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不能远离我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just leave us alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.68,0:54:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你这头老母牛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, you old cow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.84,0:54:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.52,0:54:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的你还好么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.92,0:54:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.52,0:54:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.04,0:54:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩吉 我该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peggy, what am I gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.56,0:54:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.76,0:54:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚别想那么多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to think about it tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.28,0:54:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你和孩子们想待多久都可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you and the kids can stay here as long as you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.88,0:54:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.20,0:54:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔 你现在不应该准备睡觉了么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, aren't you supposed to be getting ready for bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.52,0:54:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我想你可能想来点饼干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you might like some biscuits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.40,0:55:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.40,0:55:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.96,0:56:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.24,0:56:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.96,0:57:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mum! Mum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.92,0:57:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mum! Mum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.72,0:57:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么了 怎么了 - 是驼背男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? What is it? - The Crooked Man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.48,0:57:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么驼背 亲爱的你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Crooked what? What are you talking about, darling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.40,0:57:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 驼背的男人 - 冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Crooked Man! - Calm down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.88,0:57:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我发生什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.40,0:57:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么了 - 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.72,0:57:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我觉得他看到什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I think he's been walking around…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.76,0:58:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.92,0:58:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.32,0:58:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.44,0:58:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去叫救护车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone get an ambulance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.76,0:58:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.84,0:58:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.80,0:58:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不是你的房子 现在 告诉我你的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This is not your house. Now, what's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.64,0:58:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,咚 咚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock, knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.48,0:58:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑 谁在敲门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well. Who's there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.28,0:58:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔 比尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill. Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.64,0:59:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔 比尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill. Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.48,0:59:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,全名呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.72,0:59:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫比尔·威金斯 我72岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Bill Wilkins and I'm 72 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.12,0:59:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得是谁发出来的这种声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of that voice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.92,0:59:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点不好说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sounds confused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.92,0:59:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个老人发出的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he senile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.52,0:59:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,录音带里的这个声音是从一个11岁的小女孩身体里发出的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The voice on this tape is coming from an 11 year old girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.68,0:59:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个家庭有没有寻求教会的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family's reached out to the Church for help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.20,0:59:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻求了 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.36,0:59:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我们很不愿意卷入这件事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But truthfully, we've been reluctant to get involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.00,0:59:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个案件已经成为了媒体关注的焦点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The case has turned into a media circus over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.36,0:59:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们称之为英国版本的阿斯蒂维尔事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're calling it "England's Amityville."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.52,0:59:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.68,0:59:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕这只是个恶作剧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid it's a hoax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.68,0:59:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,教会对人们的帮助取决于他们的名声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Church's ability to help people depends on its reputation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.60,0:59:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你想我们做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you want us to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.36,0:59:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想让你们搭飞机去伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like you to fly to London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.56,1:00:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,以作为我们为期三天非官方耳目的身份出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for three days to act as our unofficial eyes and ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.76,1:00:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们什么也不用做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you don't have to do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.20,1:00:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是恶作剧 可以转身离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is a hoax, you just turn around and leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.20,1:00:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果不是恶作剧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it's not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.40,1:00:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么在伦敦有一家人急需我们的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there is a family in London that desperately needs our help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.68,1:00:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你对我们的信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your faith in us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.24,1:00:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么需求尽管告诉我 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. Well, just let me know. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.36,1:00:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他我们商量一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him we'd talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.24,1:00:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好商量的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.96,1:00:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你都听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you heard him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.24,1:00:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也不想我们过多参与{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't want us to get involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.76,1:00:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,观察一下然后做做报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just observe and report back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.28,1:00:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们经常拒绝案件没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have always been cases we've turned down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.32,1:00:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们从来没有拒绝帮助一个家庭过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has never been a family that we've refused to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.60,1:00:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾在阿斯蒂维尔家看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a vision in Amityville.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.12,1:00:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,和七年前曾看见的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the same one I had seven years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.92,1:00:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇见了你的死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a premonition of your death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.64,1:01:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这就是你封印自己能力八天的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. That's why you locked yourself away for eight days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.16,1:01:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了我的死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw my death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.44,1:01:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen it, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.60,1:01:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你画中的恶魔是真实的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon in your painting is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.32,1:01:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都看到了同一个非人类鬼魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have both seen the same inhuman spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.32,1:01:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种警告 如果我们继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a warning. If we keep doing this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.08,1:01:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.44,1:01:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的通灵能力是上帝赐予的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your visions are a gift from God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.00,1:01:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果上帝向你展示了我的死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if God is showing you my death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.80,1:01:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他做这些肯定是有理由的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he's doing it for a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.28,1:01:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是暗示你要阻止事情的发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're meant to prevent it from happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.84,1:01:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.64,1:01:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对抗争我们从不妥协{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't run from fights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.04,1:01:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.44,1:01:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.64,1:01:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须向我保证 我们只是先观察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to promise me that we're just there to observe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.32,1:01:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果任何事 以任何方式变得危险起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything turns out dangerous in any way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.00,1:01:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就告诉教会我们要离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna tell the Church, and we're gonna get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.28,1:01:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.88,1:02:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我 爱德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me, Ed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.80,1:02:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.56,1:02:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃伦夫妇 我是莫里斯·格罗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. And Mrs. Warren, I'm Maurice Grosse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.36,1:02:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你们的到来表示衷心的感谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much for coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.36,1:02:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你们会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you're gonna be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.65,1:02:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就住在在霍奇森的房子里 对么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}staying at the Hodgsons' house. Is that right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.20,1:02:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个人待在一起总是要好很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always better to be in the mix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.88,1:02:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 没错 我同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.52,1:02:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.92,1:02:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.12,1:02:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.72,1:02:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.24,1:02:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德 我们打算拍摄一些令人惊讶的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, we've managed to capture some amazing things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.92,1:02:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你看到了也会印象深刻的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll be very impressed when you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.12,1:02:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我还想听听那些带子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. I'd like to listen to those tapes again, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.24,1:02:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里面有些东西真的很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got some really interesting stuff in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.36,1:03:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维克·诺丁汉 - 嗨 维克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vic Nottingham. - Hi, Vic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.24,1:03:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 爱德·沃伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you? Ed Warren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.44,1:03:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 爱德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Ed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.08,1:03:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 这是佩吉 佩吉·霍奇森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you? And this is Peggy, Peggy Hodgson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.52,1:03:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很开心见到你 爱德·沃伦 - 幸会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice to meet you. Ed Warren. - How do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.24,1:03:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我妻子罗琳 - 幸会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is my wife, Lorraine. - How do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.76,1:03:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.28,1:03:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我走了 佩吉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll be off then, Peg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.52,1:03:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我跟孩子问好好么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you tell the kids I said hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.92,1:03:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意之极{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Of course, I will. Nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.56,1:03:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸会 - 我也是 霍奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice meeting you. - You too, hon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.72,1:03:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么开始吧 佩吉 - 行 快请进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, here we are, Peggy. - All right. Do come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.44,1:03:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我和珍妮特在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me and Janet here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.60,1:03:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其他的孩子和他们待在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My other kids are staying with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.56,1:03:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这以前是女孩们睡觉的地方 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where the girls used to sleep, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.31,1:03:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不再用这个房间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we don't use it anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.76,1:03:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.96,1:03:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 大部分的怪事都以这个房间为中心发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, most of the activity centered in this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.24,1:03:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很担心有人会因此受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were quite afraid that someone might get hurt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.56,1:03:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就锁上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why we keep it locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.24,1:03:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说珍妮特发生过漂浮现象了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that Janet has levitated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.24,1:03:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这也发生过么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did that happen in here as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.44,1:03:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 不止一次 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, more than once. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.88,1:03:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同样拍了照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got photographs of that as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.44,1:03:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想听听霍奇森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to hear Mrs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.42,1:03:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于她事情的看法 如果你不介意的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hodgson's story from her, if you don't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.56,1:03:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,邻居们捐出来的十字架 我把它们挂起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The neighbors donated them and I hung them up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.80,1:03:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能阻止家具自己移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hoping they'd keep things from moving around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.24,1:04:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有用么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has it worked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.76,1:04:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我们整晚都能听到东西移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We can hear it all night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.76,1:04:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是罗琳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there. I'm Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.12,1:04:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意我坐这里么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I have a seat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.88,1:04:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我为什么来这么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know why I'm here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.84,1:04:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈告诉了我发生的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your mom has told me about what's been going on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.64,1:04:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是 我来看看能否帮上忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm here to help, if I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.00,1:04:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于发生的事情 你想谈谈么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to talk about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.20,1:04:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你这个年纪的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when I was about your age, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.29,1:05:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有次我去医院看望我的母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}um, I was visiting my mom at a hospital{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.00,1:05:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我看到了一个天使{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I saw an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.32,1:05:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇妙吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.36,1:05:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它当时站在一个不用了的床边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was standing next to a little boy's bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.36,1:05:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很轻柔的抚摸他的脸颊 然后它停下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just gently touching his cheek and then it stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.52,1:05:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,直勾勾的望着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it looked right at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.32,1:05:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然我妈妈和护士都不相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, my mom and the nurses did not believe me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.52,1:05:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道那是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I knew it was real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.16,1:05:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道这种感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know how it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.68,1:05:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道失去朋友的滋味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it's like to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.87,1:05:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你与众不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lose your friends because you're different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.84,1:05:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我同时也知道 一个人也可以改变一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I also know that one person can change everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.92,1:05:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要做给他们看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just have to open up to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.40,1:05:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道你可以相信和你谈话的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know you could trust the people you opened up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.28,1:05:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.72,1:05:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候也会因此受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I got hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.92,1:06:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会花掉很多时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it took a long time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.40,1:06:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我终于找到了相信我的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I finally found someone who believed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.92,1:06:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.04,1:06:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我嫁给了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I married him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.72,1:06:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的太累了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just so tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.80,1:06:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能在这儿睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sleep here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.12,1:06:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前常去学校的医务室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to go to the medical{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.99,1:06:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们同意我睡在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}room at school and they let me sleep there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.60,1:06:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我太累了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I was so worn out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.40,1:06:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我现在连这样也不能做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I can't even do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.84,1:06:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都怕我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's afraid of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.84,1:07:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个朋友也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.64,1:07:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有地方可去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No place I can go to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.96,1:07:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我觉得我不是个正常人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes me feel like I'm not normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.44,1:07:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 不管是什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, whatever is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.88,1:07:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就想让你有这种感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}doing this to you wants you to feel this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.60,1:07:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.28,1:07:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 这能让它变得更强大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's what makes it stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.80,1:07:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切开始的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around the time this all started, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.56,1:07:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特朝这儿走过来了 半夜的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet started waking up here in the middle of the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.16,1:07:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个据点就是珍妮特说的 比尔 威尔金斯就死在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the spot that Janet said Bill Wilkins died, right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.56,1:07:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听谁说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get it from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.40,1:07:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.64,1:07:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们搬进来的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ex-husband bought all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.77,1:07:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的前夫买下了所有的家具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the furniture with the house when we moved in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.52,1:07:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意我问一下的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind me asking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.40,1:07:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和前夫还有希望吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, is your ex-husband still in the picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.36,1:07:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.40,1:07:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.64,1:07:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一点和解的余地吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance of reconciliation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.08,1:07:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和街角那个女人有一对双胞胎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had twins with a woman from round the corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.24,1:07:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解为没有吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna take that as a "No."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.84,1:08:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 还有很多事情要做 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, it's been a lot to deal with. - Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.60,1:08:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走的那天带走了所有的音乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took all the music the day he left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.32,1:08:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道很多人有时候会这么觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it must feel like that sometimes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.00,1:08:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的意思是 他真的拿走了所有唱片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean, literally. He took all the records.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.32,1:08:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子以前很喜欢听他的猫王的合集{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kids used to love listening to his Elvis collection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.60,1:08:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们经历的太多了 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They've been through so much. - Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.52,1:08:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这些事情才是首要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, all this is happening on top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.36,1:08:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这个时机并非巧合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. The timing isn't a coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.00,1:08:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样负面的事件通常伴随着情绪的困扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative entities often feed off emotional distress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.84,1:08:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们特别喜欢在你消沉的时候来把你击倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They like to kick you when you're down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.60,1:08:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 那看起来很不公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hardly seems fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.20,1:08:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就是不公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it really isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.28,1:08:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么时候这声音会说话吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know when the voice is gonna speak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.72,1:08:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.28,1:08:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当它说话的时候 你觉得是从你的内部发出来的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when it does, does it feel like it's coming from inside you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.96,1:08:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.20,1:08:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从我后面发出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like it's coming from behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.60,1:08:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我被利用了一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I'm being used.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.76,1:08:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是否曾经只对你一个人说过什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it ever say things just to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.48,1:08:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者只有你一个人可以听见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That only you can hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.40,1:09:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它说了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.48,1:09:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它说它想伤害你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It said it wants to hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.72,1:09:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它什么时候说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did it say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.08,1:09:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.56,1:09:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的需要这么做吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we really need that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.60,1:09:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能把它提供给教堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to be able to prove to the Church{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.64,1:09:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明她不是自己发出的那些声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she's not making the voice herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.32,1:09:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以让她嘴里喊着水 我们就能够证明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, by holding the water in her mouth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.76,1:09:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是她发出的腹语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll be able to show that it's not some form of ventriloquism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.44,1:09:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定需要坐在那椅子那儿吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she have to be in the chair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.40,1:09:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.60,1:09:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,光是看着她那样坐在那儿 就让我不舒服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes me sick to see her sitting there like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.76,1:09:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这很难 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know it's hard, but the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.81,1:09:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有迹象表面这种幽灵附着在这个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}spirit has shown an attachment to this spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.76,1:09:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她坐在那儿的话 埃德可以更容易的联系她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be easier for Ed to contact it if she's sitting there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.52,1:10:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.12,1:10:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.80,1:10:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.20,1:10:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,1997年12月21号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's December the 21 st, 1977.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.20,1:10:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是埃德和罗琳 沃伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Ed and Lorraine Warren, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.77,1:10:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,同佩吉和珍妮特·霍奇斯坐在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sitting with Peggy and Janet Hodgson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.80,1:10:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时在场的还有莫里斯·格罗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also present is Maurice Grosse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.52,1:10:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们开始吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's get started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.84,1:10:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那儿有东西想要和我们沟通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's something here that would like to communicate with us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.56,1:10:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都听着 说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're all ears. Speak up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.40,1:10:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要这个女孩儿和她的家人怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want with this girl and her family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.36,1:11:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它说它不想说话 如果你像这样看着我的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says it won't talk with you all looking at me like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.68,1:11:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪 现在来这套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange! I wonder why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.40,1:11:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它之前怎么没有不好意思说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not been shy about talking up until now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.12,1:11:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我们都背过去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about if we all turn our backs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.08,1:11:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许它会开口了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it'll speak if we do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.60,1:11:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.84,1:11:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.68,1:11:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再试一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try this again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.20,1:11:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 比尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you think, Bill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.12,1:11:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给你私人空间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've given you your privacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.96,1:11:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在出来和我们聊聊吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come on out and talk to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.56,1:12:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.64,1:12:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在和困扰这个家庭的怨灵说话吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I talking to the spirit that's oppressing this family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.80,1:12:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这样说我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.92,1:12:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我做的事是这样吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what I'm doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.52,1:12:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.84,1:12:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我要让你停止这种行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have come to put a stop to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.96,1:12:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.28,1:12:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.76,1:12:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.32,1:12:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.20,1:12:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫埃德就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.00,1:12:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父亲叫你爱德华{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father called you Edward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.44,1:12:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.72,1:12:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲叫我埃德 同大家一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father called me Ed, just like everybody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.28,1:13:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧比尔 你又不是精神病医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Bill. You're not a psychiatrist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.96,1:13:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是来这儿谈论我父亲的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not here to talk about my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.72,1:13:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说正事吧 你说如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get down to business, what do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.04,1:13:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.72,1:13:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不放过这些人呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just leave these people alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.32,1:13:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是我家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this is my house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.00,1:13:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.24,1:13:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.64,1:13:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这儿看我的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come here to see my family, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.64,1:13:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're not here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.00,1:13:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是因为你死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because you're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.00,1:13:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的家人不在这儿 他们早都离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your family did live here, they're long gone now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.20,1:13:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.92,1:13:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 如果我知道或许我能帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. If I did, maybe I could help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.04,1:13:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.84,1:13:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不放手呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why don't you just move on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.88,1:14:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信你这些鬼话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.04,1:14:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not, hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.72,1:14:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 去天堂不好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would be so wrong with going to heaven?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.20,1:14:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.24,1:14:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该去天堂的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a heaven man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.36,1:14:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有消息给你 比尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got news for you, Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.12,1:14:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 我不关心你相信什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I don't care what you believe in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.56,1:14:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到这个了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.60,1:14:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 放 开 我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help… it… let… go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.88,1:14:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 放 开 我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help… It… Let… Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.12,1:15:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感到他的存在吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sensing a presence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.64,1:15:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 恰恰相反{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just the opposite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.12,1:15:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没感觉到任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sensing anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.64,1:15:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能面对的是歇斯底里症{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could be looking at hysterical neurosis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.60,1:15:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就解释了多重性格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would explain the multiple personalities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.04,1:15:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和幻觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hallucinations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.44,1:15:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那感觉也不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't feel right, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.76,1:15:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.96,1:15:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道为什么 我心里告诉我要相信他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't explain it. My heart is telling me to believe them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.28,1:15:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见了那声音 亲耳听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that voice with my own ears, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.88,1:15:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我能感到的只是他们的恐惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but all I can sense is their own fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.88,1:15:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这 我什么都感觉不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't seem to see beyond that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.84,1:16:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得我离你那么远还能睡着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I can sleep this far away from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.16,1:16:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你没别的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're gonna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.64,1:16:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们回到家的时候 我要给你留点可期待的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll give you something to look forward to when we get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.60,1:16:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我希望你别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, love. I wish you wouldn't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.16,1:16:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮我入睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It helps me sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.08,1:16:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我知道我哪儿都不会去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I know I'm not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.28,1:16:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不抽烟 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't smoke, Mum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.24,1:16:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.20,1:17:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天和卡蜜拉在学校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That day with Camilla at school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.56,1:17:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是拿着烟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was holding the cigarette, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.44,1:17:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有打算抽 我发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I wasn't going to take a puff. I swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.80,1:17:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想在她面前看起来酷一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to look cool in front of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.64,1:17:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真蠢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.60,1:17:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.48,1:17:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我没相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I didn't believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.04,1:17:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.20,1:18:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.60,1:18:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.24,1:18:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.08,1:20:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.72,1:20:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.56,1:20:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.88,1:20:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.20,1:20:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.76,1:20:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.00,1:20:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命 - 珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.60,1:20:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.24,1:20:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.24,1:20:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.60,1:20:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Mum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.84,1:20:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍妮特 - 救命 让我出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Janet! - Help! Get me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.80,1:20:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's somebody in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.04,1:20:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打不开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't open it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.60,1:20:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.88,1:20:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.08,1:20:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.96,1:21:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.12,1:21:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么了 - 有个人在里面和珍妮特在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - There's someone in there with Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.28,1:21:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打不开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get it open!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.04,1:21:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿钥匙 去拿钥匙 马上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the key. Go get the key now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.52,1:21:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 坚持住 我们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet! Hold on! We're coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.88,1:21:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到钥匙了 我拿到钥匙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the key! I got the key!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.04,1:21:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.80,1:21:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.68,1:21:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 我们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, we're coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.44,1:21:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.64,1:21:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它从我身上拿开 求你了把它拿开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off her! Please get it off her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.64,1:21:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.48,1:21:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was someone in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.56,1:21:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼看见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him with me own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.48,1:21:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我女儿这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did this to my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.32,1:22:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是珍妮特第一天晚上被咬的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the bite wound Janet received the first night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.24,1:22:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经消退了一点 但是还是能看出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's faded a bit here, but you can still make it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.12,1:22:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真的很不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. That's pretty distinctive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.36,1:22:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,少了两个牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two missing teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.64,1:22:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 这牙比孩子们的牙都大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. And it's too big for one of the children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.84,1:22:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那是怨灵吗 比尔·威尔金斯吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this was the spirit? This Bill Wilkins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.48,1:22:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我调查了房主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tracked down the home owner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.16,1:22:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果显示他的父亲曾在这儿住过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it turns out, the owner's father lived there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.60,1:22:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字叫 威廉·威尔金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was William Wilkins and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.26,1:22:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那个椅子上脑溢血死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he died of a hemorrhage in the brain in that chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.12,1:22:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说的都是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything she said is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.04,1:22:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但都是 公开的信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All public information, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.68,1:22:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能从邻居那里听到了所有的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could have heard the whole story from a neighbor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.32,1:22:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她说的珍妮特在睡觉时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the claims{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.84,1:22:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在房子里游走又怎么解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Janet has been teleporting around the house in her sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.52,1:22:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有根有据 说她悬浮在她的床上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About as valid as their claims of her levitating off the bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.88,1:22:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生的时候你们有人在那里吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were any of you there when it happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.00,1:22:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但我有那时的照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But I have pictures of that too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.32,1:22:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.04,1:22:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在女孩的房间架设了照相机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set my camera up in the girls' room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.20,1:22:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我拿着遥控下楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then waited downstairs with the remote control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.52,1:22:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,每听到一点骚动就按下快门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fired it off whenever I heard any commotion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.84,1:22:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁证如山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to admit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.64,1:22:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的膝盖折叠起来 但她的身体又是直的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way her knees are bent, the upright position of her body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.96,1:22:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来就像 要起跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like she's just jumping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.36,1:23:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么 你昨晚就在她家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying? I mean, you were there last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.40,1:23:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你亲眼所见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw it with your own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.88,1:23:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 佩吉看到了有人在攻击珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Peggy was the one who saw someone attacking Janet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.36,1:23:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她把自己锁在房间里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she teleported herself into a room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.84,1:23:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离外界 我的天呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}locked from the outside, for goodness' sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.24,1:23:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她的声音呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about her voice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.00,1:23:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we explain that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.52,1:23:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她第一次发出那种声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the first time she was making that voice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.40,1:23:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在摄像机前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was in front of television cameras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.44,1:23:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们移开视线前 她嘴里有水时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she couldn't do it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.42,1:23:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法发出那样的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with water in her mouth until you looked away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.72,1:23:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 她可以吐出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she could have spit it out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.26,1:23:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们转回来前抿一小口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}taken another sip before you turned back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.16,1:23:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年我被威尔士家欺骗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last year, I was conned by a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.48,1:23:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们假装被恶魔控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welsh family pretending to be possessed by demons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.00,1:23:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我不知道哪一种情况更可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I don't know what was worse, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.20,1:23:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有恶魔 还是人们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the demons or the people who{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.92,1:23:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用我们的善良去相信他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}prey on our willingness to believe in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.92,1:23:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔更可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demons are worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.60,1:23:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不得不承认这很可疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you must admit, it is suspicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.60,1:23:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的觉得这一切都是她假装的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sincerely believe that she's faking everything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.20,1:23:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那佩吉呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about Peggy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.44,1:23:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者她只是在利用整个事情做借口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just using the whole thing as an excuse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.60,1:23:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以从议会中得到更好的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get better housing from the council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.52,1:23:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经申请了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's already applied!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.24,1:23:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我没有说这是个骗局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not saying it's a hoax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.36,1:24:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我们要做的事 是信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, what we do requires a leap of faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.28,1:24:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是相信没人会那样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To believe when nobody else will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.64,1:24:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你真的相信他们吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you really do believe them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.44,1:24:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. We do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.76,1:24:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有证据 教堂什么也做不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Church can't do anything without proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.80,1:24:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我们需要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.08,1:24:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我会打电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, listen. I'll make some telephone calls, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.12,1:24:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能弄到录像设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if I can get hold of some video recording equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.72,1:24:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时 我和埃德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, Ed and I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.76,1:24:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,会跟佩吉和孩子们待在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}can be spending time with Peggy and the kids, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.80,1:24:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们需要重回家庭的温暖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they need to be a family again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.80,1:24:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 妈妈 我们回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mom! We're back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.44,1:24:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在后面干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.72,1:24:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's all this, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.24,1:24:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃伦夫妇给我们带了红酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. And Mrs. Warren bought us some vinyls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.52,1:24:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给我们带了猫王的唱片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got us an Elvis record!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.72,1:24:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 蓝色夏威夷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Blue Hawaii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.32,1:24:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不要介意 有点美国风味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you don't mind. A little American culture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.56,1:24:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不介意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.72,1:24:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍妮特 - 比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Janet! - Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.08,1:24:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.80,1:24:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 大家 我想你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, I missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.72,1:24:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最近有被欺负吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, have any of you ever been bothered by a bully?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.44,1:24:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特 在学校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete, at school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.68,1:24:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是欺负比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always picking on Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.08,1:24:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的告诉我 他欺负你时你怎么做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, dear, tell me, what do you do when that happens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.12,1:24:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stick up for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.44,1:24:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 因为这房子里的幽灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, because the spirit in this house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.08,1:25:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像是欺负你的人 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- is a lot like that bully. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.04,1:25:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他欺负珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's got it in for Janet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.60,1:25:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定要帮助珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you guys gotta stick up for her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.22,1:25:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他们帮助你一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same way they stick up for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.20,1:25:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family sticks together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.72,1:25:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一方来说 他们就一定会失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, on the other hand, is a lost cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.28,1:25:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, bloody hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.60,1:25:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有东西都不能使了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had all sorts of things stop working{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.32,1:25:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没原因的 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- for no reason at all. - Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.96,1:25:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来点音乐 看看能管用不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have music in here one way or another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.04,1:25:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁的吉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose guitar is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.96,1:25:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是爸爸的 但他说我们可以用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it was Dad's, but he said I could have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.32,1:25:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 介意我用吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, do you mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.12,1:25:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.28,1:25:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点生疏 所以 你们要保证 不能笑我哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little rusty, so you gotta promise not to laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.20,1:25:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.36,1:25:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.40,1:25:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 不要笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't laugh now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.28,1:26:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家一起唱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.92,1:27:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.12,1:27:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是又小又轻巧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so small and light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.44,1:27:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么要这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.60,1:27:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样帮助人们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help people like us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.44,1:27:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你小时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were little, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.33,1:27:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有曾经担心过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you ever worry that there might be something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.52,1:27:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的床下可能会藏着什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hiding under your bed at night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.36,1:27:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 那么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.16,1:28:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的床下 真的有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bed actually had something under it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.28,1:28:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.48,1:28:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西抓住我的手把我扯到了地上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something grabbed my hand and yanked me right to the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.68,1:28:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,太黑了我什么都看不见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was too dark to see under there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.28,1:28:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我很快的跑了出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but let me tell you, I ran out of there so fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.68,1:28:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我爸爸做了什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what my dad did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.20,1:28:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我拽回那个房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He dragged me right back into{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.79,1:28:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我应该面对我的恐惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the room and told me I had to face my fears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.96,1:28:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我怕得要死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was scared to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.76,1:28:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一下子想起修女在教义里告诉我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I remembered what this nun had told me in catechism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.36,1:28:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝会在任何我们需要的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"God will be there for all who need."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.24,1:28:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我从床头柜里 拿出了这个十字架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I grabbed this crucifix out from my nightstand, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.24,1:28:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我说 不管是什么在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I tell whatever's under there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.40,1:28:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好快滚蛋 不然上帝就要惩罚他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it better leave, or God was gonna kick its butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.92,1:28:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我爸教我做的最棒的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best thing my dad ever did for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.16,1:28:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然会这样做 因为他并不是真的相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he only did it because he really didn't believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.88,1:28:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了好多年寻找 会相信我的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me years to finally find someone who did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.24,1:28:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道找到后我怕做了什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what I did then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.32,1:28:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你娶了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You married her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.16,1:29:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你都听说过咯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've heard this story before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.04,1:29:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.04,1:29:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得怎么样啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you getting on in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.92,1:29:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我们弄好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. We're done here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.24,1:29:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也修好衣柜门了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fixed the closet door, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.24,1:29:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想的话 我可以帮你们看看洗衣机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you'd like, I could take a look at the washing machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.60,1:29:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不能让你做那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I couldn't ask you to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.60,1:29:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,底下是一片混乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a disaster down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.28,1:29:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 能有多坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. How bad can it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.72,1:29:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.28,1:29:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我没说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.52,1:29:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面一切还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything still quiet in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.40,1:29:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 谢谢上帝 还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Thank goodness. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.28,1:29:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一定会是了不起的成就 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be something though, wouldn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.36,1:29:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们可以证明这个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we were able to prove beyond a shadow of a doubt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.28,1:29:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有东西超生命之上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there is a life beyond this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.20,1:29:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是历史性的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be historic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.32,1:29:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你留下的原因吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you're doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.88,1:29:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你想成为历史的一部分吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you want to be a part of something historic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.56,1:29:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是实验室 这是一个家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a laboratory, this is someone's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.04,1:30:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我认为 帮助这个家庭才是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think helping that family is the only thing that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.24,1:30:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不是那个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm sorry, I didn't mean that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.80,1:30:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多年前 我的女儿在车祸中去世了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter died in a car crash several years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.96,1:30:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之后 我开始经历一些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afterwards, I started to experience things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.80,1:30:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她想和我联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she wanted to communicate with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.24,1:30:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是的 这可以帮助我 如果我能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yes, it would help if I knew that she was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.84,1:30:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道怎么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.52,1:30:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,能有天堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.08,1:30:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.04,1:30:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.00,1:30:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.72,1:31:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.52,1:31:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.08,1:31:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来拿啊 玛格利特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it. Margaret!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.96,1:31:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼 过来拿啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, come and get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.44,1:31:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.08,1:31:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.52,1:31:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.04,1:31:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.92,1:32:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.24,1:32:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃德 你 你背后有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed? There's… There's something behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.24,1:33:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.24,1:33:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦天呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.60,1:33:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.84,1:33:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩吉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peggy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.12,1:33:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩吉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peggy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.00,1:33:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它抓住我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He grabbed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.52,1:33:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他 他想把我拉下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was him. He tried to pull me under.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.52,1:33:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.20,1:33:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天哪 你被抓伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God, you're scratched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.44,1:33:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是抓伤 这是个咬痕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a scratch, that's a bite mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.84,1:33:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像咬珍妮特那样咬了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bit me. Just like he did Janet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.56,1:34:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.56,1:34:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 珍妮特 那个可以给我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Janet, can you get me another one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.60,1:34:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.44,1:34:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.24,1:34:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.36,1:34:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.12,1:34:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.76,1:35:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,厨房里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.24,1:35:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你看到了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.12,1:35:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在玩刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's playing with the knives, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.64,1:35:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在暗处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hiding in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.00,1:35:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼 约翰尼 你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny! Johnny, what you doing?{\r}
