Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.24,1:45:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前认为这是说他自己 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought he was referring to himself, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.04,1:45:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 听第二条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Listen to the second one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.32,1:45:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me… Won't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.60,1:45:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me… Won't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.88,1:45:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.84,1:45:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我推理得没错的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm right about this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.20,1:46:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我 它不会让我走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! It won't let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.08,1:46:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我 它不会让我走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! It won't let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.64,1:46:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这儿是为了见我家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come here to see my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.68,1:46:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们现在不在这儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're not here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.48,1:47:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.64,1:47:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在可以走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.72,1:47:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我不能走 - 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I can't. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.04,1:47:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想要她 非常想要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants her. So badly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.88,1:47:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它几乎要得到她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It almost has her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.24,1:47:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我怎么阻止他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how to stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.52,1:47:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在给予 也在略夺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm given and I'm taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.72,1:47:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一出生的时候我就存在了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there at your first breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.68,1:47:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有开口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't ask for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.04,1:47:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会一直跟随你直到死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll follow you till death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.96,1:47:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.44,1:47:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.36,1:47:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.72,1:47:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你流血了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bleeding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.32,1:47:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.36,1:47:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个老人的灵魂只是个傀儡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man's spirit is just a pawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.36,1:47:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经被奴役了来磨损珍妮特的意志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been enslaved to where he's to weaken Janet's will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.48,1:48:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,被奴役了 被谁奴役{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enslaved? Enslaved by who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.00,1:48:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,被某种没有人性的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something inhuman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.52,1:48:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它以一种残忍的方式来攻击我的信念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that's taken a blasphemous form to attack my faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.76,1:48:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那间屋子里有鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a demonic presence in that house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.16,1:48:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要在维克离开之前找到他 我们得回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get Vic before he leaves. We need to go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.92,1:48:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.60,1:48:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈救我 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, help me, please! Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.08,1:48:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我 妈妈 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Mom, help me! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.56,1:48:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 离我们远点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, leave us alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.40,1:48:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格利特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.76,1:48:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格利特 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.96,1:48:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我们快从这出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.08,1:49:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我们快出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.88,1:49:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快去佩吉家 - 你不去吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go to Peggy's house! - What, you're not coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.36,1:49:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't leave Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.00,1:49:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 珍妮特 - 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! Janet! - Mum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.08,1:49:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.44,1:49:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.72,1:49:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始你说那不是真的 现在又说是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, first you say it's not real, now it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.96,1:49:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的视线被鬼蒙蔽了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her sight was being blocked by the inhuman spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.40,1:49:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个老人的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man's spirit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.51,1:49:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法穿破 直到我们离开那间屋子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't break through until we left that house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.48,1:49:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们所经历的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything they've experienced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.68,1:49:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,都证明了鬼的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been a manifestation of the demonic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.56,1:49:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,老人 驼背的人 都只是蒙蔽我们的表象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Old Man, the Crooked Man, they're just a facade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.64,1:49:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我们看不到那间屋子里真正的鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to keep us from seeing the real evil in that house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.56,1:49:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 他想帮我 但他太害怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my vision, he wanted to help me, but he was too afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.92,1:49:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他嘴里不停地说暗号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he kept speaking in a kind of riddle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.92,1:49:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直说 我在给予 我也在掠夺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like, uh, "I am given and I am taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.76,1:49:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从你刚出现时就在那儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I was there at your first breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.76,1:49:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有开口要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You didn't ask for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.68,1:49:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但会一直跟随你 直到你死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"But I will follow you until your death."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.40,1:49:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是名字 不是你要来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name. You didn't ask for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.68,1:49:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你刚出生时就给你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was given, when you were born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.20,1:50:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 知道了恶魔的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! Knowing the demon's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.37,1:50:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就有了战胜它的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}name gives us power over it and we can cast it out.{\r}
