Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.92,1:50:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有可能知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, maybe we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.20,1:50:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.36,1:50:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然他为什么给我们这个线索呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why else would he give us that clue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.36,1:50:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定觉得我们知道名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must think that we know it somehow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.56,1:50:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们现在怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.32,1:50:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对一个强大到足以蒙蔽罗琳的鬼魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An inhuman spirit powerful enough to cloud Lorraine's sight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.72,1:50:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这超乎了我的承受范围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is more than a match for me.{\r}
