Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.72,1:50:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.56,1:50:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.20,1:50:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.72,1:50:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.08,1:50:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢谢天谢地你在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.44,1:50:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍妮特在里面 - 快啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Janet's in there! - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.76,1:50:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
