Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.88,1:51:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾德 你还好么 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ed! Are you okay? - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.36,1:51:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去后面看一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go around back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.72,1:51:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 艾德 别去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Ed! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.16,1:51:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德 别去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.80,1:51:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna come with you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.76,1:51:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佩吉 待着别动 - 珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peggy, stay here. - Janet!{\r}
