Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.92,1:51:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.48,1:51:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.96,1:51:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.52,1:51:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.08,1:51:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.64,1:52:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它开不了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't open!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.52,1:52:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.00,1:52:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得把它砸了 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to break it down! - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.56,1:52:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这等着 - 把它砸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait here. - Break it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.04,1:52:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德 就在那里等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, hon, wait right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.16,1:52:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 维克马上就回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Vic'll be right back.{\r}
