Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.48,1:52:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德 拜托了 拜托就在那里等我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, please. Please, just wait for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.44,1:52:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,请等等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please wait for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.76,1:52:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能失去你 我很害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lose you. I am so scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.00,1:52:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.80,1:52:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.64,1:52:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我必须去帮她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have to help her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.00,1:52:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一预景成真了呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, what about my vision?{\r}
