Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.72,1:53:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 罗琳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.36,1:53:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, no! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.56,1:53:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 别去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.76,1:53:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.36,1:53:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
