Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.08,2:03:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她还好吗 - 是的 她很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does she look all right? - Yeah, she's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.72,2:03:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved her.{\r}
