Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.24,2:06:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.04,2:07:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我开始的事 第一个晚上发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about the beginning, the first night of your happening.{\r}
