Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.11,2:07:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在玩耍闲荡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers playing and fooling about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.24,2:07:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't quite sure, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.76,2:08:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们都很害怕 - 是的 他们目瞪口呆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They were scared? - Yeah, petrified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.48,2:08:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特呢 她怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet? What about Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.24,2:08:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它从你那出来时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it comes from your area, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.59,2:08:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 你有没有感觉喉咙里有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, do you feel anything in your throat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.88,2:08:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 你什么感觉都没有吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - You just don't feel anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.16,2:08:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我看着珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm looking at Janet.{\r}
