Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.36,2:08:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她发出了声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the voice comes from her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.52,2:08:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她嘴巴没动 哪里都没动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but her mouth doesn't move and nothing moves.{\r}
