Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.92,2:08:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.28,2:08:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮特 能不能在声音出现时告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, can you tell when the voice is gonna come through you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.28,2:08:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I don't ever.{\r}
