Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.24,2:08:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这你是知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You know it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.72,2:08:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候死的 你还记得么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What year did you die? Do you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.56,2:08:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我已经死了 61岁的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm dead. Sixty-one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:42.76,2:08:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,1961年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nineteen sixty-one.{\r}
